WEBVTT

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.180
Roar! What are you doing? Roar!

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:42.520
How long are you going to 
stay in this room? Roar!

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.610
I'm working right now. Roar.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:51.220
I'm going to buy fresh king 
salmon with my paycheck. Roar.

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:55.260
I want medovik with lots 
of honey instead! Roar!

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:56.350
Roar! Roar!

00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:58.620
You shouldn't be so picky...

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:00.830
This is what you get!

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:05.360
This is your punishment!

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:06.890
Hey.

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:09.640
I brought cake and tea for the both of you.

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:12.000
Want to take a break?

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:21.210
What are you drawing, Mommy?

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:24.440
Tada!

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:26.480
It's me and Yasuhiro!

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:28.940
But you're not with us, Mommy.

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:33.110
Well, I just drew this 
looking at the both of you.

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:36.710
I don't want to be alone with Yasuhiro!

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:37.740
Misha!

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:39.480
You don't?

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:40.620
Okay, then.

00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:43.990
Now we're together as a family.

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:47.020
Mommy!

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:50.770
Silly, what would you do without your Mom?

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:52.680
I love you, Mommy!

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:31.520
<b>Episode 11: My Maid And The Forbidden Room</b>

00:03:29.990 --> 00:03:31.520
It's finally time.

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:36.590
Now that I think about it, I play 
games all day and surf the net.

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:38.780
I had all the fun a girl could have.

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:43.960
And now I'm focused on school, have friends,

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:46.660
and you could even say I'm a normal girl!

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:49.310
And today...

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:52.620
I have a sleepover with Washiwashi!

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:56.140
A sleepover...

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:58.200
A pajama party in English.

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:02.310
A legend that only the most 
popular girls get to do,

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:04.660
and now it's finally fallen into my hands.

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:06.840
Congratulations, Milady.

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:09.500
I feel your happiness as my own.

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:12.160
We can have fun without worrying 
about when one of us has to leave.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:14.140
We get to eat together.

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:16.010
We can play games after the lights 
go out, pretending we're asleep,

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:17.680
with the blankets covering us up to hide.

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:20.500
We can eat all the candy and 
snacks, and have fun talking!

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:24.750
Yes, this is paradise: two 
active young girls get to spend

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:26.910
the night under one roof.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:31.890
However, I can't allow you to stay up late 
eating snacks or playing games in the dark.

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:35.040
What?! That's what you do at sleepovers!

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:39.110
No, there's no way I could allow 
something that hurt the eyesight

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:43.260
of those wonderful young 
eyes or pure white teeth.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.480
It's also important for a maid 
to try to protect her employer

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:46.990
from any mistakes they may be making.

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:51.410
You're such a weirdo.
Why do you have to be so strict?

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:54.770
So how long have you been standing there?

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:58.180
I am always by your side.

00:04:58.180 --> 00:05:00.710
Yes, from when I say "good morning," 
to the next "good morning."

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:02.470
So 24 hours a day, then.

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:03.510
You've got to be kidding me.

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:05.740
So what do you want?

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:10.740
Well, I wanted to ask your opinion.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:17.240
<b>All of Milady vol 7</b>

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:16.470
<i>The allure of a young Russian girl...</i>

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:19.000
<i>To put it into words, it 
would be her platinum hair.</i>

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:19.000
<b>Congratulations on your sleepover, Milady!</b>

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.130
What's this about?!

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:24.910
I guess this wasn't fancy 
enough, given your reaction.

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:27.190
No, I think it's obvious what I think!

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:30.350
I see... Well, I guess could also use a...

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:33.760
...party ball, I bet.

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:35.950
I'll go collect some pigeons from the park.

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:37.170
What about the wildlife protection laws?!

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.360
Stop it! I'd feel bad for the pigeons!

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:41.070
Don't worry about it.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.480
I won't do anything against the law.

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:44.680
<b>Pressure</b>

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:54.990
I'll allow them to act 
of their own free will.

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:56.370
I guess you can just do anything.

00:05:56.610 --> 00:06:00.180
This is all so we can give a 
warm welcome to Washizaki-sama.

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:04.420
I can't allow you any embarrassment 
with me acting as your maid.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:07.330
You existing in the first 
place brings me embarrassment.

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:11.670
Don't do anything you don't have to.

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:12.920
Milady?!

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:16.340
If you just make good food and 
snacks like you always do,

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:19.770
Washiwashi and I will be plenty happy.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.390
Milady!

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:23.480
If you understand, then 
clean this up right now!

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:24.180
Yes, Ma'am!

00:06:27.210 --> 00:06:29.290
Oh, yeah, Milady.

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:30.240
Hmm?

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:33.310
This is a good chance, 
so if you would allow me,

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:35.690
I would also like to clean that room.

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:36.870
Don't!

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:37.750
But...

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:40.000
Never go in there.

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:45.400
Yasuhiro or I will handle that 
room. Don't involve yourself.

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:47.790
<i>Milady...</i>

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:50.220
<i>Ever since we went on that trip,</i>

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:54.100
<i>she's gotten a little bit nicer to me,</i>

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:58.460
<i>but I guess it's still not enough 
to let me into this room.</i>

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:06.570
Right now, I'm happy enough that you've 
let me into your heart and welcomed me.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.860
I'm pretty sure I haven't done that.

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:26.630
It's pretty dirty.

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:31.010
Yasuhiro's been pretty busy 
with work lately, too.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:31.760
Hmm?

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:37.010
Not too long ago, whenever I'd get lonely,

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:39.780
I'd stay in this room by myself.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:44.020
I wonder why I haven't been in here lately.

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:47.480
I guess when that woman started coming.

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:51.030
Now that I think about it, she 
never does anything right.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:54.840
Anyway, I need to clean.

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:02.260
A long time ago, someone important said,

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:05.430
"Always put off until tomorrow 
what you can do tomorrow."

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:10.090
Coming!

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:13.010
I'll get it! You stay there!

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:21.520
Misha-chan, your maid is watching us.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.210
Who cares? Let's show her, then.

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:26.150
Take this!

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:29.940
Washiwashi!

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.810
How mean, Milady!

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:34.030
You have me...

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:35.910
I wanted to see your reaction!

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:44.160
You're always calm under pressure, 
cool, and a perfect maid... that's why.

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:47.670
Show me what you're really like.

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:49.920
Milady!

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:53.380
Now let's all have fun together!

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.170
Take this!

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:00.220
Yay!

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:07.370
You're going to have fun playing with 
Washizaki-sama and then take me, as well!

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:09.150
You've really grown!

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:11.080
Defamation of character, huh?

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:12.030
What?!

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:14.650
Welcome, Washiwashi!

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:18.030
Let's have a contest!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.440
Wait!

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:22.270
Uh...

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:23.790
What's going on?

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:26.040
U-Uh, well...

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:32.220
You're freezing up again after just doing 
things without thinking them through.

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:36.050
Yeah, maybe she's just a collection 
of nerves without thought.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.170
Washiwashi, you went further with 
that than I thought you would.

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:40.050
Anyway, why is Morikawa-san here?

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:42.720
I ran into her when I was coming here.

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:47.570
When I said I was going over to your house,

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:49.730
she just kind of decided to come with me.

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:52.560
Why does she care so much about me?

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:55.690
I'm sure she wants to be friends with you.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:57.700
Wants to be friends, huh?

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:02.150
Makes sense.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:03.700
In that case...

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:07.740
Takanashi, why are you here?

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:09.960
Well, this is my house.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:14.590
Anyway, would you like to 
sleepover here with us today?

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:15.990
Sleepover...

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:18.330
That's what you're up to...

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:19.270
Sure!

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:21.430
We're going to have a sleepover battle!

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:23.970
You can stop saying that, already.

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:28.980
<b>Uzamaid!</b>

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:33.980
<b>Uzamaid!</b>

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:47.960
Everyone, it's not that cold out today, 
so I've set up a teatime outside.

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:51.000
Washizaki, that's enough!

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:59.720
I-I hate to admit it, but 
you're really good at cooking.

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:01.470
Thank you.

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:08.690
You have such a nice house and yard, and 
then a wonderful maid like the Master.

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:11.820
Is this what it's like 
to have a lot of money?

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:13.310
I keep saying that's not it.

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:15.360
Then are you doing something 
illegal on the side?

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:20.240
The man of the house is currently so busy 
at work, he can't come home on the weekends.

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.700
That's why I asked Washiwashi to sleep over.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:26.240
Sorry about that.

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:31.330
That's why I will also be staying 
here to take care of everything,

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.830
so please ask me if you need anything.

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:37.210
I'm sure you'll be able to take 
care of anything possible, Master!

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:40.110
Then protect us all night.

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:42.300
But not from inside the house...

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:43.340
From this yard.

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:45.470
But, Milady...

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:49.700
I heard that there have been suspicious 
individuals around here lately, and I'm so scared.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:52.600
But I think you can protect us.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.820
Please leave it to me, Milady!

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:56.460
I see. Thank you.

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:59.520
Milady, please don't bow!

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:00.440
<i>She's so easy.</i>

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:03.420
Misha-chan, by "suspicious 
individual", do you mean that

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:05.770
person over there that I think 
I've seen somewhere before?

00:12:05.770 --> 00:12:06.480
Huh?

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:07.200
What?

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.550
You, again!

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:11.980
No, I was just getting off on 
the fact that I wanted to be

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:14.080
a part of their group, but no one noticed me,

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:17.840
and Kamoi was completely 
ignoring me the whole time!

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:19.570
Yeah, I'll listen to your 
story down at the station.

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:21.470
Hey, let go!

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:25.170
<i>Those eyes, like they're 
looking at someone crazy...</i>

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:25.830
<b>Love</b>

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:27.210
<i>That really gets me going.</i>

00:12:27.210 --> 00:12:30.170
<i>This is why everyone says the 
Japanese police are so good!</i>

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:36.530
Uh, that girl isn't suspicious. 
At least, probably not...

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:39.540
This is our neighbor, Midorin.

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:41.590
Hello there. My name is Midorin.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:44.110
<b>Ukai Midori (33)</b>

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:45.990
She's 33 years old...

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:56.880
<b>Excited</b>

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:50.020
Those little girls are looking at me like,

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:53.800
"I don't know what I would do if my Mom,

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:56.880
who's not that far off in age, 
wore the same clothes."

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.540
Stop it, Midorin!

00:12:57.900 --> 00:13:02.660
<b>Excited</b>

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:03.180
Why are you acting like you're supposed 
to be here, First Lieutenant?

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:05.910
I can only imagine that you being 
here would be an impediment

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:07.800
to a little girl learning good morals.

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:10.220
My being here is an impediment...

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:09.540
<b>Love</b>

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:15.110
Well, it's gotten cold out.

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:15.980
Yeah.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.980
We should head in.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:20.110
We can head in right through here, right?

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:21.360
We can't go in there.

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:28.320
Let's warm ourselves up first.

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:32.720
The bath's nice.

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:34.540
I'm all warm now.

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:37.710
It's big enough for the three of us.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:38.960
Don't let your guard down.

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:45.340
I'm your maid, so I've come to wash your 
little hair, little back, and little butts!

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:50.220
<i>There's no way she could let this chance go.</i>

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:53.850
Misha-chan, your hair is nice, 
but your skin is nice, too.

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:55.600
It's nice and smooth and shiny.

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:56.350
Huh?

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.460
Th-Thank you.

00:13:58.460 --> 00:13:59.530
Takanashi!

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:01.990
My hair and skin are nice, too!

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:03.310
Let's fight!

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:04.840
Again?

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:09.040
I think I was in too long.

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:11.160
That's your fault.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:12.620
Time to change...

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:13.550
Huh?

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:15.700
What's wrong, Washiwashi?!

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:18.010
I know! Your underwear is gone, isn't it?

00:14:18.010 --> 00:14:19.740
All right, time to put her to death!

00:14:19.740 --> 00:14:21.880
Uh, that's not it.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:22.630
Look at this.

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:23.260
Huh?

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:25.910
Can't sit still.

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:27.380
What's wrong, Kamoi?

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.690
Well, I was just thinking 
it's about time for the

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:32.260
Milady and her friends to get 
out of the bath and start changing.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:36.110
If you want to secretly videotape something, 
then record me doing something embarrassing.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:41.390
<b>Excited</b>

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:41.400
Then that video could get leaked, and people 
will see me from all over the world.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:44.770
I don't feel like scaring the 
world with any images of you,

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:49.990
and I wouldn't do anything to little 
girls that would be immoral.

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:53.070
And how do you record someone 
secretly without it being immoral?

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:55.300
I just want Milady to...

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:01.710
The two of you look really good!

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:04.700
Did you make these pajamas?

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:07.130
Yes, I made them myself!

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.500
I hope you like them!

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:11.100
They're great.

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:13.350
Yeah, they're wonderful.

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:15.100
Where's Milady?

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:18.910
Changing out someone's 
clothes without asking...

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:19.980
You perv.

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.420
Milady!

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:23.020
But, well... I hate to admit it,

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:26.230
but I do owe you a little bit lately.
I'll wear your stuff, for today.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:32.110
This is the first time Milady 
is adorning her body with my clothes...

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:34.270
You don't have to say it so weirdly!

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:36.680
Huh?

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:38.630
I see.

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:41.320
Her pulse has stopped.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:45.290
<b>Uzamaid!</b>

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:43.920
<b>The end</b>

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:44.960
We're not over yet!

00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:48.930
Dinner was good.

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:53.200
I didn't know that there was food in this 
world that got close to my mom's curry.

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:55.680
That's one of her only good points.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:56.910
I'm not so sure.

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:59.810
I think your maid is wonderful.

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:02.970
Yeah, you've got it nice here.

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:03.560
What?!

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:06.690
She's beautiful, nice, and considerate.

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:08.710
She's got great fashion sense, too!

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:11.530
She's a perfect woman, 
on the top of the list.

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:14.280
I'd love to be her.

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:17.590
<i>They haven't seen her bad side, that's why.</i>

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:21.240
<i>I mean, she can do anything, but...</i>

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:22.080
<i>Huh?</i>

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:28.090
<i>Why did someone that perfect quit 
the JSDF without becoming a pilot?</i>

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:32.010
<i>Midorin didn't tell me the reason, either.</i>

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:36.060
Misha-san, you really care 
about your maid, don't you?

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:36.740
Huh?

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:39.220
Are you a "tsundere"? I bet you are.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:41.350
Wh-What are you saying?

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:43.700
I don't care about her, at all.

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:45.000
She's so annoying, too.

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:46.980
Anyway, that's not it!

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:50.480
How dare you!

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:52.990
Washiwashi!

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:06.100
You two! I'll show you what 
pillow fights are really about,

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:08.600
having lived through fights 
with my younger brothers!

00:17:08.600 --> 00:17:10.670
I'm sorry!

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:12.760
Washiwashi, your personality just changed!

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:20.180
Sounds fun, but they might be a bit 
too loud for the neighbors, Kamoi.

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:30.900
So wonderful...

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:32.830
Wait! Don't go, Kamoi!

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:36.450
You haven't even burned their 
pajama party into your retinas yet.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:40.050
I was about to be purified and go to Heaven.

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.490
But I can't stop.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.340
Even if I'm not physically 
with the little girls,

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:45.820
it's something you can venerate.

00:17:45.820 --> 00:17:50.460
Yes, even if you can't see it, 
you can use your mind's eye.

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:58.720
I do love you, but I also find 
those parts of you a turn off.

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:23.620
Gotta pee.

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:28.010
The bathroom is right over there.

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:29.880
Just come with me.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:31.900
Are you scared?

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:34.030
I-I'm not scared!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.240
Stay there.

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:38.140
Don't leave, no matter what, okay?

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:40.050
Fine...

00:18:42.110 --> 00:18:43.880
What was that sound just now?

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:45.800
I'm going to try opening it up...

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:54.220
<b>She's doing some weird fetish thing</b>

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:00.720
What is that girl doing?!

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:02.590
I don't know!

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:25.390
I'm too scared!

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:27.700
Mommy! Yuina!

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:29.770
Morikawa-san, are you okay?

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:32.710
D-Did you pee yourself?

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:34.520
A little bit.

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:36.970
Hey! What are you making me say?!

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:09.570
<i>They're sure close.</i>

00:20:11.780 --> 00:20:13.780
It's early.

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:14.690
Oh, I know.

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:17.090
Kuma!

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:19.570
Oh,

00:20:19.890 --> 00:20:21.070
there he is.

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:23.200
Sorry about last night.

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:26.170
I had three people total in there, 
so there wasn't enough room.

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:31.280
It's kind of nice and refreshing to 
wake up early every once in a while.

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:37.090
I guess I need to clean up my 
Mom's room and make it nice, too.

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:38.020
Huh?

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:47.190
What's going on?

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:52.210
Oh, Milady, you're up early.

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.320
Who went in here?!

00:20:59.710 --> 00:21:00.690
Milady...

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:03.250
Who went in here?!

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.250
This is where we...

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:07.410
It's our memories...

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:10.290
We can head in right through here, right?

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:12.160
Wait...

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:14.160
Morikawa-san.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:15.400
I'm sorry.

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:21.350
As you know last night, I was 
watching the house from outside,

00:21:21.350 --> 00:21:25.160
but it was so cold, so I thought 
that you wouldn't notice if

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:28.150
I warmed myself up if I came 
into the house through there.

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:29.530
It was you?!

00:21:29.530 --> 00:21:31.540
I apologize.

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:33.480
You're the maid,

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:35.940
and you ignored my orders...

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:39.060
Yes, it was me.

00:21:39.350 --> 00:21:41.300
This is a place for my family.

00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:45.140
Not some place you can enter!

00:21:45.890 --> 00:21:47.950
You dummy!

00:21:52.740 --> 00:21:53.790
Milady...

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:03.570
Mommy...
